    "points": [
      "8\nAbstract\nThoracentesis is deﬁned as drainage of ﬂuid from the\npleural cavity",
      "It can be safely performed at a patient’s\nbedside, ofﬁce or procedure unit, or radiology suite",
      "The\nmost common indication is evaluation of a new pleural\neffusion of uncertain etiology"
